WEBVTT

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:11.690
You have one new message.

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:17.860
Hello? This is Dr. Ishida from
Uminari University Hospital.

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:22.080
Well, tomorrow's your
birthday, Hayate-chan.

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:26.700
How about we go out to lunch
after your checkup?

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:31.290
Could you let me know
before you come tomorrow?

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:32.210
I'll be waiting, then.

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:36.130
End of messages.

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:18.920
It's already midnight...

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:16.150
Releasing seal.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:29.450
Activating.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:40.250
The Beginning Was All Too Sudden.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:59.520
I'll wrap up this morning's training with
some shooting control practice, okay?

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:00.570
All right.

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:02.740
Lyrical Magical!

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:08.320
Holy light, come to my hand.

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:10.330
Follow my will and
resound through the sky!

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.170
Divine Shooter, shoot!

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:21.590
Control...

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:32.930
Accel!

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:57.290
Last one!

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:09.010
Don't mind, my master.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:12.220
Thanks, Raising Heart.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:18.640
My name is Takamachi Nanoha.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:23.690
I was just your average third-grader
until a little while ago, but...

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:26.650
thanks to an event that happened in the beginning of spring,

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:29.490
I've become a mage.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:32.700
How would you grade my training today?

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:34.200
About 80 points.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:36.200
I see.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:50.220
All the people back then who led me to
magic, courage, and so many encounters...

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:53.140
I haven't been able to see them since then.

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:58.810
But I'm sure I'll see them
again sometime soon.

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.570
Nanoha, you got something in the mail.

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:10.860
Really?

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:15.240
It's from overseas. Looks like it's
from this "Fate Testarossa" again.

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:17.160
Thanks, Onii-chan!

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:20.250
They're always from that girl, huh?
Is it another video letter?

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:22.210
Yeah! I'm sure it is!

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:25.840
You two have been exchanging letters
like this for over half a year now, huh?

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:28.630
Fate-chan's going to be coming
over to play soon, right?

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:32.720
I'll be sure to give her a huge
welcome when she gets here!

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:33.970
Yeah!

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:36.810
And we finally found
Yuuno's real owner, too...

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:38.770
So it's been pretty lonely
around here recently.

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:41.230
That's because you were
so close to him all the time.

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:42.600
Um...

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:45.230
We might be able to
keep him again for a bit,

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:46.940
depending on his owner.

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:48.530
That'd be great!

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:50.110
It would be.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:52.490
Mom, do you think Yuuno
will remember me?

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:55.450
<i>Fate-chan... Yuuno-kun...</i>

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:59.080
<i>Chrono-kun and Lindy-san... Amy-san...</i>

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.870
<i>I wonder how you're all doing...</i>

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:15.680
Preparations for docking with the
TSAB main office are complete.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:19.180
Everything is going as expected.
Good to hear.

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:25.940
Excuse me. Captain, would
you like another cup of tea?

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:28.190
Thank you, Amy. I would indeed.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:37.530
After we dock the Arthra at HQ,
we'll finally be able to relax, huh?

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:38.530
Indeed.

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:40.490
What are the kids up to?

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:44.250
All three should be on break right now.

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:48.840
Enforcer Chrono and Fate-chan
were just doing some combat training.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:51.170
And Yuuno-kun joined in, so...

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:54.760
Is that so? Even though tomorrow's
the last day of the trial,

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:56.590
they're really taking it easy.

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:02.020
Here you go.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:05.440
Well, it's a trial that we're sure to win.

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:15.780
Now then, let's run through
everything one last time.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:21.410
Fate will be in the defendant's seat,
and respond to the judge's questions like so.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:22.580
Yeah.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:25.660
Arf, you'll sit there as well this time, so...

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:26.540
I understand.

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:30.630
And me and Ferret Boy will be
in the witness seats this time.

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:32.670
You should answer the questions
as they're worded here.

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.670
Yeah. I understand.

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:35.930
Wait a second!

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:36.680
What's wrong?

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.930
Who's "Ferret Boy"?! Who?!

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.680
You are.
What about it?

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:51.190
I may be in my animal form a lot, but
"Yuuno Scrya" is a great name, you know!

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:53.030
Yuuno, calm down...

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.950
Chrono, you shouldn't
tease him too much...

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:59.160
Don't worry.
I'm just trying to lighten the mood.

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:04.750
In reality, it's safe to say that
you'll be found not guilty...

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:09.080
or you may have to serve a few
years of probation at most...

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:12.170
but you should still keep
these answers in mind.

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:13.500
Yes, sir.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:14.670
Got it...

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:24.220
Good work as always, Admiral Lindy.
Is everything going according to plan?

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:27.180
It is, Leti.
How about everything on your end?

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:31.730
Yes, regarding the docking approval
and maintenance for the Arthra...

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:38.990
But we're not too happy about
a certain situation over here.

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:40.820
"Not too happy"?

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:42.950
The Lost Logia.

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:45.910
The Class 1 hazardous material
we've been searching for...

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:51.250
It seems to have been discovered
in ancient ruins on many worlds...

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:53.710
and it's creating quite an uproar between
those in charge of the investigation.

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:54.880
Is that so?

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:59.630
We've dispatched some operators, so now
we're waiting to hear back from them.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:00.630
I see...

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:43.890
More small fry...

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:47.890
This'll only be a drop in the bucket, but...

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:59.360
Your magical powers will be
food for the Book of Darkness!

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:29.390
Well, see you guys tomorrow.

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:30.470
Yeah.

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:32.390
Bye bye!

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:59.130
Is this the one you wanted?

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:02.630
Yes... thank you very much.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:06.010
Really? We're the same age?

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:11.810
Yeah. I've seen you around here and
thought, "Oh, maybe she's my age."

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.680
Actually, I've thought that, too...

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:18.020
Um, my name's Tsukimura Suzuka.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.570
Suzuka-chan...

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:22.740
I'm Yagami Hayate.

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:24.070
Hayate-chan.

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:27.160
Although, "Hayate" is written in hiragana.
It's a pretty weird name, huh?

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:30.660
Not at all!
I think it's a pretty name.

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:32.620
Thanks.

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:51.760
Thanks a lot, Suzuka-chan. Here's fine.

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.180
Okay. Well, then...

00:13:57.350 --> 00:14:00.940
Thanks for talking to me.
Really, thank you.

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:03.940
Yeah. See you again, Hayate-chan.

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:14.410
Hayate-chan, you're not too cold, are you?

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:17.540
I'm fine. Aren't you cold, Shamal?

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:19.210
Not at all.

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:25.590
Signum!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:27.630
Hello.

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:35.020
What do you want to have for dinner?

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:38.060
Ah... right, what should we have?

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:41.480
Why don't we think about it at the
supermarket while we look for ingredients?

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:43.360
Sounds good.

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:47.440
Now that I think about it,
is Vita out somewhere again today?

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:50.450
Umm... well, yes...

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:53.200
It seems that she's out
playing around somewhere,

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:57.040
but Zafira's with her,
so you needn't worry.

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:58.370
Is that so...?

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:04.500
However, even if we're worlds apart,
we'll always be right by your side.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:08.050
That's right.
We will always be with you.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:11.640
Thank you...

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.900
How is it, Vita?
Think you'll be able to find it?

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:33.660
The source feels like it's here,
yet not here...

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:39.580
The source of that strangely massive
amount of mana I've been sensing...

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:44.250
If we captured the source, we could easily
gain another twenty pages in the Book.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.170
Let's split up and search for it.

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:47.420
I'll leave the Book of Darkness with you.

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:49.210
Okay, Zafira.

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:51.130
Search thoroughly, alright?

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:52.300
I know.

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:00.930
Barrier Field, expand.

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:03.520
Gefängnis der Magie!

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:19.870
Caution, emergency.

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:25.040
A barrier?!

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:35.550
A magic signal!
The real thing this time!

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:40.060
Let's go, Graf Eisen.

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:41.060
Roger.

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:48.320
It approaches at high speed.

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:51.070
It's getting closer to us?

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:11.840
Approaching target.

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:26.350
It comes.

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:39.620
Homing bullet.

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:54.800
Tödlicher Schlag!

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:13.280
Raising Heart, please!

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:15.650
Stand by, Ready.

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:16.650
Set up.

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:11.710
Schwalbefliegen!

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:28.730
I don't remember doing anything
to provoke you like this!

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:32.310
Where are you from?
Why are you doing this?

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:38.240
If you don't tell me,
how am I supposed to know?!

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:50.000
You little brat!

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:53.830
Flash Move.

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:55.960
Shooting Mode.

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:01.970
Listen...

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:07.760
Divine...

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:09.350
to me!

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:10.890
Buster.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.590
Graf Eisen, Cartridge Load!

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:39.170
Explosion.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:45.390
Raketenform.

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:57.360
Raketen...

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:15.790
Hammer!

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:42.650
Protection.

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:53.830
Break through it!

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:54.910
Roger.

00:22:52.430 --> 00:22:55.350
<i>Is this how it's going to end...?</i>

00:22:55.350 --> 00:23:00.690
<i>No... Yuuno-kun...
Chrono-kun... Fate-chan!</i>

00:23:12.950 --> 00:23:14.950
Sorry we're late, Nanoha.

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:17.200
Yuuno-kun...

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:19.120
Allies, huh?!

00:23:24.670 --> 00:23:25.920
Scythe Form.

00:23:29.170 --> 00:23:30.470
Friends.

00:25:09.360 --> 00:25:11.780
Beginnings always come so suddenly.

00:25:11.780 --> 00:25:14.990
But this situation is just too sudden!

00:25:14.990 --> 00:25:18.120
In this chaos and confusion,
what should I do?!

00:25:18.120 --> 00:25:20.200
We're in a crisis, facing formidable enemies.

00:25:20.700 --> 00:25:23.200
Why are they coming after us like this?

00:25:24.080 --> 00:25:27.380
Next time on
Mahou Shoujo Lyrical Nanoha A's:

00:25:27.380 --> 00:25:30.800
Episode Two:
The Storm of Battle, Once Again.

00:25:31.460 --> 00:25:32.420
Lyrical Magical...

00:25:33.050 --> 00:25:33.880
...doing our best.
